## Proposed Changes

We will create a modular, clean directory structure in the workspace (`practice/` folder):
- `index.html` - The semantic structure of the portfolio.
- `css/`
  - `styles.css` - Custom variables, layout structure, typography, and responsive styles.
  - `components.css` - Glassmorphism, buttons, forms, project cards, and timelines.
  - `animations.css` - Custom keyframes, scroll reveals, hover effects, and glowing gradients.
- `js/`
  - `main.js` - Main entry, scroll-reveal setup, theme management, and mobile nav.
  - `portfolio.js` - Dynamic project filtering, active timeline interaction, and interactive skills card.
  - `contact.js` - Form validation, custom floating label effects, and success animations.
- `assets/` - Generated SVGs, illustrations, and images.

